eraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F03%2Fcrp-7717-gfd3-980x628.jpg&amp;n=90UPZaoJEjo9zjct6iX0Ew 980w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F03%2Fcrp-7717-gfd3-480x308.jpg&amp;n=qngLI3nk99liUvIkBfmExQ 480w" data-lzl-src="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F03%2Fcrp-7717-gfd3.jpg&amp;n=TkG3mFBBZ2J4PQDDpx0gg"><noscript lzl=""><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1237" height="793" src="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F03%2Fcrp-7717-gfd3.jpg&amp;n=TkG3mFBBZ2J4PQDDpx0gg" alt="What Your Peers Are Saying - ModMed delivers a really polished EHR product that feels like something out of the future. James McGehee, registered nurse - See Our Solutions in Action" title="What Your Peers Are Saying - ModMed delivers a really polished EHR product that feels like something out of the future. James McGehee, registered nurse - See Our Solutions in Action" srcset="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F03%2Fcrp-7717-gfd3.jpg&amp;n=TkG3mFBBZ2J4PQDDpx0gg 1237w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F03%2Fcrp-7717-gfd3-980x628.jpg&amp;n=90UPZaoJEjo9zjct6iX0Ew 980w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F03%2Fcrp-7717-gfd3-480x308.jpg&amp;n=qngLI3nk99liUvIkBfmExQ 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1237px, 100vw" class="wp-image-275650"></noscript></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_1 exit-timed-right span-4 span-4-p span-8-t span-4-m  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0 headline-m-h ph-s pt-s  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><div> <h3 id="bad-form-overlay-titletext" class="form-header-text" style="padding-bottom: 10px;">Welcome Back</h3> <p>Get a demo.</p> </div></div> </div><div id="#demo-code-ou812" class="et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_0"> <div class="et_pb_code_inner"><div><iframe class="iframe-2col-2 lzl bjs" src="data:image/png;base64," style="width: 100%;" frameborder="0" id="overlay-iframe" data-lzl-src="https://www2.modmed.com/l/27382/2024-12-20/8y9h47"></iframe></div>  </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="divi-overlay-container-320102" class="overlay-container"> <div class="divioverlay-bg animate__animated"></div> <div id="overlay-320102" class="divioverlay" style="display:none;" data-bgcolor="rgba(0,0,0,0.85)" data-enablebgblur="0" data-preventscroll="0" data-enableesckey="1" data-scrolltop="" data-cookie="0" data-enableajax="0" data-contentloaded="0" data-animationin="fadeIn" data-animationout="fadeOut" data-animationspeedin="0.5" data-animationspeedout="0.5" data-closeclickingoutside="0"> <a href="javascript:;" class="overlay-close overlay-customclose-btn-320102"><span class="">×</span></a> <div class="animate__animated entry-content"> <div class="et-l"> <div class="et_builder_inner_content et_pb_gutters3"> <div class="dov_dv_section et_pb_section_1 exit-timed et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_1 tips-blurbs et_pb_gutters1"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_1"> <div class="et_pb_code_inner"> <wistia-player media-id="27v87vcw7m" aspect="1.7777777777777777" autoplay="true"><div class="wistia_preload_transcript_outer_wrapper" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items: center; margin-top:-56.25%;"><div class="wistia_preload_transcript_inner_wrapper" style="overflow: auto;"><p class="wistia_preload_transcript_text" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" style="text-align: justify; font-size: 5px !important;">Say hello to the future of healthcare communication. Are phone calls and administrative work preventing you from providing your highest quality care for patients? With Clara's patient communication platform, your practice can automate some manual tasks so you have more time to improve the patient experience. Clara's innovative software enables patients to initiate conversations on the communication channel they prefer, whether via phone call, text message, or web chat. You can even send email reminders. All messages are consolidated into one patient thread within Clara, which also seamlessly interfaces with your preferred EHR. Patients have the option to schedule their own appointments without ever having to call your office or sign in to a patient portal. Once the appointment is scheduled, Clara will automatically send personalized pre visit instructions. Save time at check-in by allowing patients to fill out forms digitally prior to their visit. Send pre visit reminders to help reduce no show appointments. After the appointment, send post visit instructions to the patient's phone rather than sending them home with a big stack of papers. To continue the great patient experience, check-in with patients after their visit to help answer any questions that may have come up. With Clara, your practice can help keep patients engaged before, during, and after their visit so your practice stays top of mind. Eliminate repetitive tasks, empower your patients, and get back to doing what you love. Say hello to the future of healthcare communication. Say hello to Clara.</p> </div></div></wistia-player></div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="dov_dv_section et_pb_section_2 exit-timed et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_2 tips-blurbs et_pb_gutters1"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_3  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_3"> <div class="et_pb_code_inner"> <wistia-player media-id="27v87vcw7m" aspect="1.7777777777777777"><div class="wistia_preload_transcript_outer_wrapper" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items: center; margin-top:-56.25%;"><div class="wistia_preload_transcript_inner_wrapper" style="overflow: auto;"><p class="wistia_preload_transcript_text" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" style="text-align: justify; font-size: 5px !important;">Say hello to the future of healthcare communication. Are phone calls and administrative work preventing you from providing your highest quality care for patients? With Clara's patient communication platform, your practice can automate some manual tasks so you have more time to improve the patient experience. Clara's innovative software enables patients to initiate conversations on the communication channel they prefer, whether via phone call, text message, or web chat. You can even send email reminders. All messages are consolidated into one patient thread within Clara, which also seamlessly interfaces with your preferred EHR. Patients have the option to schedule their own appointments without ever having to call your office or sign in to a patient portal. Once the appointment is scheduled, Clara will automatically send personalized pre visit instructions. Save time at check-in by allowing patients to fill out forms digitally prior to their visit. Send pre visit reminders to help reduce no show appointments. After the appointment, send post visit instructions to the patient's phone rather than sending them home with a big stack of papers. To continue the great patient experience, check-in with patients after their visit to help answer any questions that may have come up. With Clara, your practice can help keep patients engaged before, during, and after their visit so your practice stays top of mind. Eliminate repetitive tasks, empower your patients, and get back to doing what you love. Say hello to the future of healthcare communication. Say hello to Clara.</p> </div></div></wistia-player></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="divi-overlay-container-320104" class="overlay-container"> <div class="divioverlay-bg animate__animated"></div> <div id="overlay-320104" class="divioverlay" style="display:none;" data-bgcolor="rgba(0,0,0,0.85)" data-enablebgblur="0" data-preventscroll="0" data-enableesckey="1" data-scrolltop="" data-cookie="0" data-enableajax="0" data-contentloaded="0" data-animationin="fadeIn" data-animationout="fadeOut" data-animationspeedin="0.5" data-animationspeedout="0.5" data-closeclickingoutside="0"> <a href="javascript:;" class="overlay-close overlay-customclose-btn-320104"><span class="">×</span></a> <div class="animate__animated entry-content"> <div class="et-l"> <div class="et_builder_inner_content et_pb_gutters3"> <div class="dov_dv_section et_pb_section_3 exit-timed et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 tips-blurbs et_pb_gutters1"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_4  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_4"> <div class="et_pb_code_inner"> <wistia-player media-id="f3pzusohg6" aspect="1.7777777777777777" autoplay="true"><div class="wistia_preload_transcript_outer_wrapper" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items: center; margin-top:-56.25%;"><div class="wistia_preload_transcript_inner_wrapper" style="overflow: auto;"><p class="wistia_preload_transcript_text" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" style="text-align: justify; font-size: 5px !important;">Schweiger Dermatology Group is the largest dermatology provider in the Northeast. Before we used Clara, we were primarily a telephone based company. We had a central call center, but there was a lot of delay in communications. One of the biggest challenges we face as a practice is the, we call it like the endless circle of phone tag with our patients where, you know, a patient calls in, we send in a request to our clinical team. They have to then call the patient back and they're leaving a voicemail. Patient then calls back and that loop continues again and again. Clara does a great job of trying to prevent phone tag. It makes it easy for the patient. The interface with Clara is very straightforward. It's nice that they don't need a password to log in, that it can be done right through their text messaging, which pretty much everybody's comfortable with now. There's not a lot of extra button pushing, not a lot of extra web pages to scroll to, no app to download. It's really very easy to use. Once we implemented Clara, we put the patient in direct contact with the provider, cutting out the middleman and the message taking, and patients were able to get answers right away. We've saved hundreds and hundreds of hours of phone calls. I think one of the ways that Clara differentiates themselves from other platforms is their transparency. The ability to see all of the conversation between a patient, everything internally and externally that's happening between a staff member and a patient really allows everybody to be in the know and take any action needed. They seek to understand our problem and they come to us with really creative solutions. They've been an amazing partner from the beginning. Using Clara has definitely improved our revenue because we've been able to increase our numbers of patients. It does give the patient a little bit more control, is something you don't generally see in antiquated medical communications. Clara really does show innovation. The way we use it has worked very well with our patient support center. I would absolutely recommend Clara to other healthcare providers. I think we would still be in the dark ages of communication if we didn't use Clara.</p> </div></div></wistia-player></div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="dov_dv_section et_pb_section_4 exit-timed et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_4 tips-blurbs et_pb_gutters1"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_5  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_6"> <div class="et_pb_code_inner"> <wistia-player media-id="f3pzusohg6" aspect="1.7777777777777777"><div class="wistia_preload_transcript_outer_wrapper" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items: center; margin-top:-56.25%;"><div class="wistia_preload_transcript_inner_wrapper" style="overflow: auto;"><p class="wistia_preload_transcript_text" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" style="text-align: justify; font-size: 5px !important;">Schweiger Dermatology Group is the largest dermatology provider in the Northeast. Before we used Clara, we were primarily a telephone based company. We had a central call center, but there was a lot of delay in communications. One of the biggest challenges we face as a practice is the, we call it like the endless circle of phone tag with our patients where, you know, a patient calls in, we send in a request to our clinical team. They have to then call the patient back and they're leaving a voicemail. Patient then calls back and that loop continues again and again. Clara does a great job of trying to prevent phone tag. It makes it easy for the patient. The interface with Clara is very straightforward. It's nice that they don't need a password to log in, that it can be done right through their text messaging, which pretty much everybody's comfortable with now. There's not a lot of extra button pushing, not a lot of extra web pages to scroll to, no app to download. It's really very easy to use. Once we implemented Clara, we put the patient in direct contact with the provider, cutting out the middleman and the message taking, and patients were able to get answers right away. We've saved hundreds and hundreds of hours of phone calls. I think one of the ways that Clara differentiates themselves from other platforms is their transparency. The ability to see all of the conversation between a patient, everything internally and externally that's happening between a staff member and a patient really allows everybody to be in the know and take any action needed. They seek to understand our problem and they come to us with really creative solutions. They've been an amazing partner from the beginning. Using Clara has definitely improved our revenue because we've been able to increase our numbers of patients. It does give the patient a little bit more control, is something you don't generally see in antiquated medical communications. Clara really does show innovation. The way we use it has worked very well with our patient support center. I would absolutely recommend Clara to other healthcare providers. I think we would still be in the dark ages of communication if we didn't use Clara.</p> </div></div></wistia-player></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="divi-overlay-container-76972" class="overlay-container"> <div class="divioverlay-bg animate__animated"></div> <div id="overlay-76972" class="divioverlay" style="display:none;" data-bgcolor="rgba(0,0,0,0.85)" data-enablebgblur="0" data-preventscroll="0" data-enableesckey="1" data-scrolltop="" data-cookie="0" data-enableajax="0" data-contentloaded="0" data-animationin="fadeIn" data-animationout="fadeOut" data-animationspeedin="0.5" data-animationspeedout="0.5" data-closeclickingoutside="0"> <a href="javascript:;" class="overlay-close overlay-customclose-btn-76972"><span class="">×</span></a> <div class="animate__animated entry-content"> <div class="et-l"> <div class="et_builder_inner_content et_pb_gutters3"><div class="dov_dv_section et_pb_section_5 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular"> <div id="choose-your-specialty" class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_5"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3>Choose your specialty below to learn more</h3></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_code et