t-to-do-business-with.svg" alt="" title="CRP-14196-G2-easiest-to-do-business-with" class="wp-image-318293"></noscript></span> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_25 space-2xl light-mode et_pb_with_background et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_30 ts-break-early rgap-xs rgap-fix"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_40 span-6 span-t-4 span-m-4 valign-middle order-2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_2 klara-text-pill body-m-b no-margin-b mb-none  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et_pb_animation">󿁓</span></span></div> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Video</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_44 p-xs valign-middle mt-l mb-s  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><blockquote> <p class="klara-quote-body">We have saved hundreds and hundreds of hours of phone calls.</p> <p><cite class="klara-quote-author"><strong>Jason Miller</strong>, MD, Freehold, NJ</cite> </p></blockquote></div> </div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_3_wrapper  et_pb_module"> <a id="overlay_unique_id_320104" class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_3 button-link-primary et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="#watch-video" data-icon="󿀘" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*">Watch video</a> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_41 span-6 span-t-4 span-m-4 order-1  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_13"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="1800" height="1200" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Jason Miller" title="Jason Miller" srcset="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller.png&amp;n=ApMcsU3J17RRG31N4tbufQ 1800w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-1280x853.png&amp;n=Fd3YNPRYD38cO7kvKj7Bw 1280w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-980x653.png&amp;n=M4rz0kEn5x1V5eT4oeCpw 980w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-480x320.png&amp;n=9c6nZYZSI9cTkCUYYZLwPA 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) and (max-width: 1280px) 1280px, (min-width: 1281px) 1800px, 100vw" class="wp-image-318294 lzl" data-lzl-srcset="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller.png&amp;n=ApMcsU3J17RRG31N4tbufQ 1800w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-1280x853.png&amp;n=Fd3YNPRYD38cO7kvKj7Bw 1280w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-980x653.png&amp;n=M4rz0kEn5x1V5eT4oeCpw 980w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-480x320.png&amp;n=9c6nZYZSI9cTkCUYYZLwPA 480w" data-lzl-src="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller.png&amp;n=ApMcsU3J17RRG31N4tbufQ"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="1800" height="1200" src="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller.png&amp;n=ApMcsU3J17RRG31N4tbufQ" alt="Jason Miller" title="Jason Miller" srcset="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller.png&amp;n=ApMcsU3J17RRG31N4tbufQ 1800w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-1280x853.png&amp;n=Fd3YNPRYD38cO7kvKj7Bw 1280w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-980x653.png&amp;n=M4rz0kEn5x1V5eT4oeCpw 980w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2Fcrp-14195-Jason-Miller-480x320.png&amp;n=9c6nZYZSI9cTkCUYYZLwPA 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) and (max-width: 1280px) 1280px, (min-width: 1281px) 1800px, 100vw" class="wp-image-318294"></noscript></span> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_26 space-2xl light-mode et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_31 rspan-8 span-shift-3 rspan-t-8 span-shift-t-1 rspan-m-4 span-shift-m-1 mb-2xl"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_42  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_cta_0 headline-l-h paragraph-m-b no-margin-b button-primary-large et_pb_promo  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_no_bg"> <div class="et_pb_promo_description"><h2 class="et_pb_module_header">Focus on patient care, automate the other stuff</h2><div><p>Use the patient engagement platform that’s there for every step in the healthcare journey to help your practice provide a better patient experience.</p></div></div> </div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_4_wrapper et_pb_button_alignment_center et_pb_module"> <a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_4 button-primary-large et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://www.modmed.com/what-we-do/patient-engagement/workflow-automation/" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*">Experience the journey</a> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_32 rspan-6 span-shift-4 rspan-t-6 span-shift-t-2 rspan-m-4 span-shift-m-1 mb-2xl"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_43  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_29"> <div class="et_pb_code_inner"><div class="lottie-wrapper"> <lottie-player src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/crp-14547-Patient-Journey-Loop-Tooltips-seemless-loop.json" class="lottie" speed="1" mode="forward" renderer="svg" loop autoplay> </lottie-player> </div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_27 space-2xl light-mode et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_33 rspan-8 span-shift-3 rspan-t-8 span-shift-t-1 rspan-m-4 span-shift-m-1 mb-2xl"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_44  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_cta_1 headline-l-h no-margin-b et_pb_promo  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_no_bg"> <div class="et_pb_promo_description"><h2 class="et_pb_module_header">Multichannel patient communication, all in one place</h2><div><p>Enable your patients to send text messages to your practice, while webchat captures online visitors. Convert call volume into secure messages with call-to-text functionality, and transcribe voicemail messages with voicemail transcription. No matter how your patients reach out, it all lands in ModMed® Patient Engagement, powered by Klara®.</p></div></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_34 no-margin-h rgap-l rgap-fix mb-l"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_45 span-3 span-4-t span-4-m  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_3 headline-m-h no-margin-b mb-s  et_pb_text_align_center  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et_pb_animation">󿁀</span></span></div> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h3 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Messaging</span></h3> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Make it easy for patients<br>to reach your practice</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_5_wrapper et_pb_button_alignment_center et_pb_module"> <a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_5 button-link-primary et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://www.modmed.com//what-we-do/patient-engagement/patient-communication/" data-icon="󿀘" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*">Learn more</a> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_46 span-3 span-4-t span-4-m  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_4 headline-m-h no-margin-b mb-s  et_pb_text_align_center  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et_pb_animation">󿀆</span></span></div> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h3 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Web chat</span></h3> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Capture new patient<br>interest, 24/7</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_6_wrapper et_pb_button_alignment_center et_pb_module"> <a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_6 button-link-primary et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://www.modmed.com//what-we-do/patient-engagement/patient-communication/" data-icon="󿀘" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*">Learn more</a> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_47 span-3 span-4-t span-4-m  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_5 headline-m-h no-margin-b mb-s  et_pb_text_align_center  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et_pb_animation">󿀿</span></span></div> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h3 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Call-to-text</span></h3> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Allow patients who call<br>to start texting instead</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_7_wrapper et_pb_button_alignment_center et_pb_module"> <a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_7 button-link-primary et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://www.modmed.com//what-we-do/patient-engagement/patient-communication/" data-icon="󿀘" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*">Learn more</a> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_48 span-3 span-4-t span-4-m  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_6 headline-m-h no-margin-b mb-s  et_pb_text_align_center  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et_pb_animation">󿁖</span></span></div> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h3 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Voicemail<br>transcriptions</span></h3> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Read minute-long<br>voicemail calls in seconds</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_8_wrapper et_pb_button_alignment_center et_pb_module"> <a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_8 button-link-primary et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://www.modmed.com//what-we-do/patient-engagement/patient-communication/" data-icon="󿀘" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*">Learn more</a> </div> </div> </div> </div><div id="instructions" class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_28 space-3xl light-mode et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_35 ts-break-early rgap-2xl rgap-fix"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_49 span-6 span-t-4 span-m-4 valign-middle order-2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_14"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="760" height="760" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Klara patient communication chat bubbles" title="CRP-14195-patient-communication-bubbles" srcset="/?seraph