ain_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et_pb_animation">󿀎</span></span></div> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Patient Communication</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_8 headline-l-h body-m-b  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h2 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Communicate with patients on their preferred channel</span></h2> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>ModMed Patient Engagement offers easier, faster communication for both patients and practices.</p> <ul> <li>Connect via text, web chat, and phone</li> <li>Enable patients to self-schedule appointments and easily start message conversations<p></p> </li><li>Have patients submit forms online without needing a patient portal, username or password</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_9_wrapper  et_pb_module"> <a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_9 button-tertiary-large et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://www.modmed.com/what-we-do/patient-engagement/patient-communication/" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*">Learn more</a> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_29 space-3xl light-mode et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_36 mm20-circle-stat-row rgap-fix flex-row"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_51  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_31"> <div class="et_pb_code_inner"><svg viewbox="0 0 211 211" class="mm20_circle_counter" data-percent="84" xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <circle id="backdrop" r="98" cy="105.5" cx="105.5" stroke-width="15" stroke="#E0DBFA" fill="none"></circle> <circle id="progress" r="98" cy="105.5" cx="105.5" stroke-width="15" stroke="#502D7F" fill="none"></circle> <text x="105.5" y="120.5" fill="#1D1D1D" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="middle" class="circle-text display-s fade"><tspan class="num bold">1</tspan><tspan>%</tspan></text> </svg></div> </div><div class="et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_9  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>utilization rate compared to patient portals<sup>1</sup></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div id="appointment-reminders" class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_30 space-3xl light-mode et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_37 ts-break-early rgap-2xl rgap-fix"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_52 span-4 valign-middle pb-s-ts  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_10 klara-text-pill body-m-b no-margin-b  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et_pb_animation">󿀱</span></span></div> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Team Collaboration</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_11 headline-l-h body-m-b  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h2 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Decrease manual message triaging</span></h2> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Help your staff respond to patients faster with intelligent message routing.</p> <ul> <li>Automatically route patient messages to staff members – immediately</li> <li>Create shared inboxes and @mention other staff to increase healthcare collaboration<p></p> </li><li>Connect with pharmacies, labs, and other network providers without sitting on hold</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_10_wrapper  et_pb_module"> <a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_10 button-tertiary-large et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://www.modmed.com/what-we-do/patient-engagement/patient-communication/" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*">Learn more</a> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_53 span-4 shift-6 shift-t-5 span-m-4 shift-m-1 valign-middle  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_15"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="760" height="760" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Klara team collaboration messages" title="Collaboration messages" srcset="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2FCRP-14195-Collaboration-messages.webp&amp;n=yDLMGUYlpkOiDBoRym5RA 760w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2FCRP-14195-Collaboration-messages-480x480.webp&amp;n=XkEGlgCyWvPJQTmZDiJvw 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 760px, 100vw" class="wp-image-318297 lzl" data-lzl-srcset="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2FCRP-14195-Collaboration-messages.webp&amp;n=yDLMGUYlpkOiDBoRym5RA 760w, /?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2FCRP-14195-Collaboration-messages-480x480.webp&amp;n=XkEGlgCyWvPJQTmZDiJvw 480w" data-lzl-src="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2FCRP-14195-Collaboration-messages.webp&amp;n=yDLMGUYlpkOiDBoRym5RA"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="760" height="760" src="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2FCRP-14195-Collaboration-messages.webp&amp;n=yDLMGUYlpkOiDBoRym5RA" alt="Klara team collaboration messages" title="Collaboration messages" srcset="/?seraph_accel_gi=wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F03%2